# Line endings are part of repository truth here, not a formatting preference.
#
# The change engine hashes bytes and diffs lines. The evaluation corpus declares
# gold symbol ranges, evidence line numbers, and content hashes against files as
# they were authored — with LF. Without this file Git's `core.autocrlf` rewrites
# them to CRLF on any Windows checkout, every fixture hash changes, and the
# Phase 4 corpus fails on a fresh clone while passing for whoever wrote it.
#
# So: normalized in the repository, LF in the working tree, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.sqlite binary
*.db binary
